1
00:00:00,226 --> 00:00:03,686
(Sheldon:)Or just my normal look
of haughty derision?

2
00:00:05,397 --> 00:00:09,067
(Raj:)-You don't know we're wrong yet.
-Haughty derision it is.

3
00:00:10,236 --> 00:00:13,826
(Amy:)Excuse me. I'm Amy Farrah Fowler.
You're Sheldon Cooper.

4
00:00:13,989 --> 00:00:15,699
(Sheldon:)Hello, Amy Farrah Fowler.

5
00:00:15,866 --> 00:00:18,406
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry to inform you
that you have been taken in...

6
00:00:18,577 --> 00:00:20,157
(Sheldon:)...by unsupportable mathematics...

7
00:00:20,329 --> 00:00:22,669
(Sheldon:)...designed to prey
on the gullible and the lonely.

8
00:00:22,832 --> 00:00:26,752
(Sheldon:)Additionally, I'm being blackmailed
with a hidden dirty sock.

9
00:00:27,461 --> 00:00:29,751
(Amy:)If that was slang, I'm unfamiliar with it.

10
00:00:31,173 --> 00:00:34,593
(Amy:)If it was literal,
I share your aversion to soiled hosiery.

11
00:00:36,262 --> 00:00:40,352
(Amy:)I'm here because my mother and I have
agreed that I will date at least once a year.

12
00:00:40,516 --> 00:00:41,556
(Sheldon:)Interesting.

13
00:00:41,725 --> 00:00:45,015
(Amy:)My mother and I have
the same agreement about church.

14
00:00:45,187 --> 00:00:48,607
(Amy:)I don't object to the concept of a deity,
but I'm baffled by the notion...

15
00:00:48,774 --> 00:00:50,484
(Amy:)...of one that takes attendance.

16
00:00:51,610 --> 00:00:54,280
(Sheldon:)Well, then you might
want to avoid East Texas.

17
00:00:54,947 --> 00:00:57,987
(Amy:)Noted. Now, before this goes any further,
you should know...

18
00:00:58,159 --> 00:01:02,619
(Amy:)...that all forms of physical contact
up to and including coitus are off the table.

19
00:01:04,623 --> 00:01:06,833
(Sheldon:)May I buy you a beverage?

20
00:01:08,127 --> 00:01:09,957
(Amy:)Tepid water, please.

21
00:01:18,304 --> 00:01:20,474
(Howard:)Good God, what have we done?

